message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Evolutionary search for quantum medical-image classifiers"
abstract: >-
  A genetic algorithm that designs variable-length quantum convolutional
  classifier circuits (HierarQcal + PennyLane) for MedMNIST medical-image
  classification, searching over 8-qubit single and dense PCA angle encodings.
